stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SignupInitiated: RM signs up
    
    SignupInitiated --> PersonalfragebogenInProgress: Starts form
    PersonalfragebogenInProgress --> PersonalfragebogenCompleted: Submits form
    
    PersonalfragebogenCompleted --> ContractGenerated: Proceeds directly (no chatbot/trial)
    
    ContractGenerated --> ContractSigned: Admin confirms signature
    
    ContractSigned --> AwaitingAdminReview: Enters pool (target HotelGroup)
    
    AwaitingAdminReview --> UnderAdminReview: Claimed by Admin
    
    UnderAdminReview --> Approved: Admin approves
    UnderAdminReview --> Rejected: Admin rejects
    
    Approved --> [*]: Transition to Active (Scope Assigned)
    Rejected --> [*]: Transition to Rejected
